id: og_grain_c
name: Grain Terminal III
description: Grain Terminal. Most of the building is silo you cannot go inside, so everything that can be walked on is a thin skin wrapped round something enormous and solid. Built as a river grain terminal; the last barge was part loaded and the conveyors are still full.

